# Sentia AI stack for live-build (Debian 13/Trixie).
#
# This list is what makes the image Sentia rather than a minimal Debian live
# system. The local AI must work immediately after installation with no cloud
# account and no Internet connection, so the runtime and the model are both
# installed into the image rather than downloaded on first use.
sentia-router
sentia-system-tools
sentia-terminal
sentia-health
sentia-firstboot
sentia-llama-cpp
sentia-granite-model
